      "x": 100,
      "y": 140,
      "text": "Embedded NATS Core Server",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "nats-text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 170,
      "text": "Client port: :4222\n  → Hub's own aggregator connects\n    here as a local NATS client\n\nLeaf port: :7422\n  → 46 agents connect here\n  → Routes messages between leaves\n\nNo JetStream, no clustering\nNo TLS (v1), user/pass auth",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "aggregator",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "agg-title",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 350,
      "text": "Aggregator (NATS Client)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "agg-text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 380,
      "text": "Connects to localhost:4222\n\nSUB latency.results.>  (wildcard)\n  → Deserialize JSON result\n  → matrix.Update(result)\n  → broadcastToWS(result)\n\nSUB latency.health.>\n  → Log agent heartbeats",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "http-server",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "http-title",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 140,
      "text": "HTTP Server (:443)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "http-text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 170,
      "text": "REST API:\n  GET /api/v1/matrix\n  GET /api/v1/matrix?from=X\n  GET /api/v1/pair/{from}/{to}\n  GET /api/v1/regions\n  GET /api/v1/nearest?lat&lon\n  GET /api/v1/az-pairs?primary=X\n  GET /api/v1/health\n  GET /api/v1/trigger-sweep\n\nWebSocket:\n  WS /ws/live\n    → Snapshot on connect\n    → Stream results real-time\n\nStatic Files:\n  GET / → index.html (Globe.gl)\n  Embedded via go:embed\n\nCORS: Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *\nAuth: query string ?auth=TOKEN\n      (trigger-sweep only)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 12
    },
