      "x": 755,
      "y": 170,
      "text": "Latest:\n  map[src][tgt]*Result\n  ~1,035 unique pairs\n\nHistory:\n  map[\"src:tgt\"][]Result\n  96 samples (24h)\n  ~20MB total\n\nThread-safe: RWMutex",
